{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Vivica takes a step back to look at her newly organized conspiracy board. \"I think this will be easier now if anyone wants to add information..\" she says mostly to herself","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:02:31.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876707480007229451","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
