{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Goop? I was told she turned into mercury, is that what you mean?\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:03:47.422000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876707797729955870","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Mercury! That makes more sense. Yeah, she turns into goop — mercury. Hm. Mercury is a poison. Wonder how Lucy's poison affected her.\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:05:01.808000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876708109727432714","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"She shrugs, \"I'm not sure how a lot of that Noir stuff works which is where that version of her likely came from.\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:06:12.940000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876708408076664842","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Ah. The Noir can bring thoughts and memories to life.\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:06:34.423000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876708498182909962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Which is why there's a bunch of monsters in there, because people cast out their worst fears. And I mean, fears like paranoia and existential dread.\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:07:09.642000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876708645902106625","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"But there are good things in there too, like Hope.\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:07:27.084000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876708719059140608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I would like to think so, I dont really go into that part of the city ever.\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:08:06.338000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876708883702378527","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Now that I think about it, wouldn't that mean someone cast out their hope there?\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:08:19.574000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876708939218190336","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I don't think it's a bad thing to give your good thoughts out. It's where they grow legs and come to life.\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:09:12.126000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876709159637250069","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"To cast out hope? Who would do that..\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:09:12.523000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876709161302368326","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"It's better for good things to come to life than bad things, you know?\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:09:31.851000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876709242369884170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Honestly, I don't know. Just trying to wrap my head around how that place runs after only being there twice.\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:09:43.078000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876709289459335208","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I've met Hope. Lovely little fella.\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:10:10.208000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876709403250786344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"No I understand that, but to take hope out of yourself.. isn't that kinda sad?\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T06:10:10.903000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876709406165856286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
